Increases melee and ranged attack speed by $s3% and casting speed by $s1% for all party and raid members.  Lasts $d.

After the completion of this effect, those affected will become Sated and unable to benefit from Bloodlust again for $57724d.

@ext:This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

You gain Poison Mastery when learning any Rogue Poison. 

This Mastery automatically unlocks additional Essential Rogue Poisons when you reach their Class Point requirements at no additional ability essence cost.
